        </div>

        <div class="basic" constraint="docker">
            <dl>
                <dt>Health all-stopped mode:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <img class="img" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-dyskmc">
                    <select name="health_all_stopped_mode">
                        <option value="" selected>Use global mode</option>
                        <option value="critical">Critical</option>
                        <option value="warn">Warn</option>
                    </select>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p>
                    Controls how an all-stopped folder is classified.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt>Status warn threshold (%):</dt>
                <dd>
                    <img class="img" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-dyskmc">
                    <input type="number" name="status_warn_stopped_percent" min="0" max="100" step="1" placeholder="Use global threshold">
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p>
                    Optional per-folder override for the stopped percentage warning threshold used by the Status chip accent.
                    <br>
                    Leave blank to use the global Status threshold.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="basic" constraint="docker">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="update-column">Hide update column:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input class="basic-switch" name="update_column" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu" />
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]update-column-tooltip">
                    Will <b>NUKE</b> the update column for this folder.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="override-default-actions">Override default actions:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input class="basic-switch" name="override_default_actions" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu" />
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]override-default-actions-tooltip">
                    Will remove the default menu and replace it with the custom actions set below.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="default-action">Hide default action button:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input class="basic-switch" name="default_action" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu" />
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]default-action-tooltip">
                    Will remove the default action button like start, stop and restart from the folder context menu.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="expand-tab">Expanded on Docker/VM tab:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input class="basic-switch" name="expand_tab" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu" />
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]expand-tab-tooltip">
                    Will make the folder start expanded on the Docker/VMs tab.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="expand-dashboard">Expanded on Dashboard tab:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input class="basic-switch" name="expand_dashboard" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu" />
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]expand-dashboard-tooltip">
                    Will make the folder start expanded on the Dashboard.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt>Dashboard overflow mode:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <select name="dashboard_overflow">
                        <option value="default">Default</option>
                        <option value="expand_row">Expand row</option>
                        <option value="scroll">Scrollable panel</option>
                    </select>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p>
                    Controls how expanded dashboard members are shown for this folder.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="regex">Regex:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <input type="text" name="regex" data-fv-oninput="updateRegex(this)" value="">
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]regex-tooltip">
                    Optional automation rule for this folder.
                    <br>
                    Matching container or VM names will be auto-included here.
                    <br>
                    Example for matching a Pterodactyl egg ID: <b>[0-9a-zA-Z]{8}-[0-9a-zA-Z]{4}-[0-9a-zA-Z]{4}-[0-9a-zA-Z]{4}-[0-9a-zA-Z]{12}</b>.
                    <br>
                    Editing this field will replace manual member selections with the current regex matches.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic custom-action-wrapper-parent">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="custom-actions-folder">Custom actions:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <div class="custom-action-wrapper">​</div>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <span data-i18n="[html]custom-actions-folder-tooltip">
                    Add optional actions to this folder menu.
                    <br><b>Standard</b> actions control selected containers or VMs directly.
                    <br><b>Custom</b> actions run a User Scripts task if that plugin is installed.
                    <br>Use the action list below to edit, remove, and reorder what appears for this folder.
                </span>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic">
            <dl>
                <dt>​</dt>
                <dd>
                    <button type="button" class="custom-action fv-custom-action-button" aria-haspopup="dialog" data-fv-onclick="customAction(); return false;"><i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span data-i18n="editor.actions.add-custom">Add a custom action</span></button>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]custom-action-tooltip">
                    Opens the action editor for a new folder action.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <input class="folder-btn-submit" type="submit" value="Submit" data-i18n="[value]submit">
        <input class="folder-btn-apply-settings" type="button" value="Apply to folders..." data-fv-onclick="applyFolderSettingsToFolders(); return false;">
        <input class="folder-btn-copy" type="button" value="Save as copy" data-fv-onclick="submitForm(this.form, true); return false;">
        <input class="folder-btn-reset" type="button" value="Reset unsaved changes" data-fv-onclick="resetUnsavedChanges(); return false;">
        <input class="folder-btn-cancel" type="button" value="Cancel" data-i18n="[value]cancel" data-fv-onclick="cancelBtn()">
        <span id="unsavedIndicator" class="folder-unsaved-indicator" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-xcjvns">Unsaved changes</span>
        <div id="fvFolderMembersSection" class="basic fv-folder-members-section" hidden>
            <dl>
                <dt>Folder members:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <div class="fv-folder-members-panel">
                        <div class="fv-folder-members-intro">
                            <div>
                                <strong>Nested folders</strong>
                                <span>Drag child folders to control the order shown in previews and expanded rows.</span>
                            </div>
                            <span id="fvFolderMembersSummary" class="fv-folder-members-summary">0 folders</span>
                        </div>
                        <div id="fvFolderMembersEmpty" class="fv-folder-members-empty" hidden>No nested folders are currently inside this folder.</div>
                        <table class="fv-folder-members-table" aria-label="Nested folder order">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Order</th>
                                    <th>Folder</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="fvFolderMembersBody"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p>
                    This only changes the order of child folders. Docker containers and VMs stay managed in the member list below.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="basic order-section">
            <dl>
                <dt data-i18n="order">Order:</dt>
                <dd>
                    <table class="sortable">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>
                                    Order
                                </th>
                                <th data-i18n="table-name">
                                    Name
                                </th>
                                <th data-i18n="table-included">
                                    Included
                                </th>
                                <th data-i18n="table-show-in-preview">
                                    Show in preview
                                </th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </dd>
            </dl>
            <blockquote class="inline_help">
                <p data-i18n="[html]order-tooltip">
                    Use the up/down buttons to set your desired order. Regex-selected entries are auto-included and locked.
                </p>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>


<div class="dialogCustomAction" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-uydnfn"></div>

<div class="templateDialogCustomAction" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-569beu">
    <div class="fv-action-dialog-layout">
        <div class="fv-action-dialog-intro">
            <span class="fv-action-dialog-intro-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-bolt"></i></span>
            <div>
                <strong>Configure folder action</strong>
                <p>Add an action to this folder's context menu. Choose a built-in state action or run a User Scripts task.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="fv-action-dialog-section" aria-label="Action details">
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-section-head">
                <span aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-sliders"></i></span>
                <div><h3>Action details</h3><p>Name the action and choose how it runs.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-field-grid">
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field is-wide">
                    <span data-i18n="name">Name:</span>
                    <input type="text" name="action_name" autocomplete="off" maxlength="120">
                    <small>This label appears in the folder context menu.</small>
                    <em class="fv-action-field-error" data-action-error="name" hidden>Enter an action name.</em>
                </label>
                <fieldset class="fv-action-type-field is-wide">
                    <legend data-i18n="custom-actions-type">Type:</legend>
                    <select name="action_type" class="fv-action-type-select" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                        <option value="0" data-i18n="editor.actions.standard">Standard</option>
                        <option value="1" data-i18n="editor.actions.user-script">User script</option>
                    </select>
                    <div class="fv-action-type-options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Action type">
                        <button type="button" class="fv-action-type-option" data-action-type="0" role="radio" aria-checked="true">
                            <i class="fa fa-cogs" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong data-i18n="editor.actions.standard">Standard</strong><small data-i18n="editor.actions.control-members">Control selected folder members.</small></span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="fv-action-type-option" data-action-type="1" role="radio" aria-checked="false">
                            <i class="fa fa-file-text-o" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong data-i18n="editor.actions.user-script">User Script</strong><small data-i18n="editor.actions.run-user-script">Run a task from the User Scripts plugin.</small></span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="fv-action-dialog-section standard" constraint="action-type-0" aria-label="Standard action">
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-section-head">
                <span aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-cogs"></i></span>
                <div><h3>Standard action</h3><p>Choose the state change and which members it controls.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-field-grid">
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field">
                    <span data-i18n="custom-actions-action">Action:</span>
                    <select name="action_standard">
                        <option value="0" data-i18n="custom-actions-action-0">Cycle</option>
                        <option value="1" data-i18n="custom-actions-action-1">Set</option>
                        <option value="2" data-i18n="custom-actions-action-2">Restart</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field cycle" constraint="action-standard-0">
                    <span>Behavior</span>
                    <select name="action_cycle">
                        <option value="0" data-i18n="custom-actions-cycle-0">Start - stop</option>
                        <option value="1" data-i18n="custom-actions-cycle-1">Pause - resume</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field set" constraint="action-standard-1" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-xcjvns">
                    <span data-i18n="custom-actions-states">States:</span>
                    <select name="action_set">
                        <option value="0" data-i18n="custom-actions-set-0">Start</option>
                        <option value="1" data-i18n="custom-actions-set-1">Stop</option>
                        <option value="2" data-i18n="custom-actions-set-2">Pause</option>
                        <option value="3" data-i18n="custom-actions-set-3">Resume</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <div class="fv-action-dialog-field is-wide action-subject">
                    <div class="fv-action-target-label"><span data-fv-action-target-label data-i18n="custom-actions-cts">Containers:</span><strong data-fv-action-target-count>0 selected</strong></div>
                    <select name="action_elements" multiple></select>
                    <div class="fv-action-target-tools">
                        <button type="button" data-action-target-command="all"><i class="fa fa-check-square-o" aria-hidden="true"></i> Select all</button>
                        <button type="button" data-action-target-command="clear"><i class="fa fa-square-o" aria-hidden="true"></i> Clear</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fv-action-target-chips" data-fv-action-target-chips aria-live="polite"></div>
                    <small data-action-help="targets">Only members currently available to this folder are listed.</small>
                    <em class="fv-action-field-error" data-action-error="targets" hidden>Select at least one member.</em>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="fv-action-dialog-section custom" constraint="action-type-1" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-xcjvns" aria-label="User Script action">
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-section-head">
                <span aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-file-text-o"></i></span>
                <div><h3>User Script</h3><p>Run an installed User Scripts task from the folder menu.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-field-grid">
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field is-wide">
                    <span data-i18n="custom-actions-script">Script:</span>
                    <input type="text" name="action_script" autocomplete="off">
                    <small>Enter the script name exactly as it appears in User Scripts.</small>
                    <em class="fv-action-field-error" data-action-error="script" hidden>Enter a script name.</em>
                </label>
                <label class="fv-action-dialog-field is-wide">
                    <span data-i18n="custom-actions-arguments">Arguments:</span>
                    <input type="text" name="action_script_args" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Optional command arguments">
                </label>
                <div class="fv-action-sync-field is-wide">
                    <div><strong data-i18n="custom-actions-script-sync">Wait for completion</strong><small>Keep the action in the foreground until the script finishes.</small></div>
                    <input class="basic-switch-sync" name="action_script_sync" type="checkbox" data-fvplus-style="fv-u-xcjvns">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="fv-action-dialog-section is-appearance" aria-label="Appearance">
            <div class="fv-action-dialog-section-head">
                <span aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-picture-o"></i></span>
                <div><h3>Appearance</h3><p>Optionally override the action's Font Awesome icon.</p></div>
            </div>
            <label class="fv-action-dialog-field fv-action-icon-field">
                <span>Icon class</span>
                <span class="fv-action-icon-control"><span class="fv-action-icon-preview" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-cogs"></i></span><input type="text" name="action_script_icon" autocomplete="off" placeholder="fa-cogs"></span>
                <small>Leave blank to use the default icon for the selected action type.</small>
            </label>
        </section>

        <div class="fv-action-validation-summary" role="alert" hidden>Review the highlighted fields before saving.</div>
    </div>
</div>
